If you are trying to decide which package puts a person on site and what that costs, our [AV technician hire](/blog/av-technician-hire/) guide covers that package by package comparison in detail. This page covers the coverage itself, phase by phase, with the real equipment our crew manages and the real projects we have delivered it on.

